  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Capacity Building of OISEVI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall development objective of the proposed IDF is to improve the performance of the Ibero-American Road Safety Observatory (OISEVI) and participating countries, primarily of their data collection and analysis processes. This will be achieved through building institutional capacity in the OISEVI and participating countries by: collaborating in the production of baseline statistics with countries that have difficulties in doing so; providing expert technical assistance to road safety agencies in LAC with weaker institutional and technical capacities; improving the training methodology of data coordinators from all member countries; and developing a scheme of information exchange in order to make more efficient the process by which information is sent to OISEVI&#x2019;s Executive Secretariat.</narrative>
  </description>
